{
    "title": "UNO!\u2122",
    "description": "UNO!\u2122 is now on mobile! Take the classic card game from the kitchen table anywhere! Now with new rules, world series tournaments, various game modes, and much more, including a festive Halloween theme. Whether you\u2019re at home, or on the go, an UNO!\u2122 veteran or completely new, UNO!\u2122 has something for everyone in the family. UNO!\u2122 is a fun and memorable family-friendly card game wherever and whenever.\r\n\r\nReady. Set. UNO!\u2122\r\n- Play the classic card game, UNO!\u2122, or select from a variety of house rules to play in real-time matches, if you dare!\r\n- Compete in spine-chilling tournaments and events to win free rewards and ascend to the top the haunted leaderboards!\r\n- Partner up with friends or family, play in 2v2 mode and collaborate to win.\r\n- Connect anytime, anywhere with family and friends from around the world, in the spirit of Halloween.\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\nThe Classic Game at your Fingertips\r\nNew to UNO!\u2122 or wanting to play your favorite card game? Tap Quick Play and start up a new game with classic UNO!\u2122 rules. Get ready for new monthly rewards and spooky events!\r\n\r\nPlay with Fiends\r\nPlay with friends or family! Set up your own house rules and bring spooktacular fun to your Halloween gatherings. UNO!\u2122 is a family-friendly party that makes it free and easy for anyone to join!\r\n\r\nBuddy Up\r\nFind a friend or family member and partner up to battle in 2 player teams. Help each other reduce your hand (or your partner's) to zero as quickly as possible to beat the other team!\r\n\r\nConnect, Chat, Shout UNO!\u2122\r\nConnect with your buddies in UNO!\u2122 with clubs and send each other gifts. Make a strategy and remember to shout UNO before anyone else.\r\n\r\nNew Challenges at Every Level\r\nCompete in spine-chilling World Series tournaments and special events to win free rewards. Top the leaderboards and show off to your friends and family! Then spin the wheel and try your fortune to get free rewards every day!\r\n\r\nGo Wild \u2013 No, Really\r\nThis no-holds-barred mode is as wild as UNO!\u2122 gets. Forget the classic mode - haunted house rules on, two-deck play, and free winnings up to 600 times what you put in to make you the coin master! But beware, in this unpredictable game mode, it's a gaming trick or treat where you either win big or go home empty-handed! Are you up for the challenge?\r\n\r\nUNO!\u2122 Esports\r\nThe UNO!\u2122 Mobile Community Cup 2024 is now open! Players across countries including the USA, Canada, Brazil, and Mexico can join for a year of action-packed competitions and tons of ghostly rewards! This is your chance to make it big as an eSports star!\r\n\r\nVisit our official site at www.letsplayuno.com\r\nFollow us on Facebook for more updates: www.facebook.com/UNOnow",
    "descriptionHTML": "UNO!\u2122 is now on mobile! Take the classic card game from the kitchen table anywhere! Now with new rules, world series tournaments, various game modes, and much more, including a festive Halloween theme. Whether you\u2019re at home, or on the go, an UNO!\u2122 veteran or completely new, UNO!\u2122 has something for everyone in the family. UNO!\u2122 is a fun and memorable family-friendly card game wherever and whenever.<br><br>Ready. Set. UNO!\u2122<br>- Play the classic card game, UNO!\u2122, or select from a variety of house rules to play in real-time matches, if you dare!<br>- Compete in spine-chilling tournaments and events to win free rewards and ascend to the top the haunted leaderboards!<br>- Partner up with friends or family, play in 2v2 mode and collaborate to win.<br>- Connect anytime, anywhere with family and friends from around the world, in the spirit of Halloween.<br><br>FEATURES<br>The Classic Game at your Fingertips<br>New to UNO!\u2122 or wanting to play your favorite card game? Tap Quick Play and start up a new game with classic UNO!\u2122 rules. Get ready for new monthly rewards and spooky events!<br><br>Play with Fiends<br>Play with friends or family! Set up your own house rules and bring spooktacular fun to your Halloween gatherings. UNO!\u2122 is a family-friendly party that makes it free and easy for anyone to join!<br><br>Buddy Up<br>Find a friend or family member and partner up to battle in 2 player teams. Help each other reduce your hand (or your partner&#39;s) to zero as quickly as possible to beat the other team!<br><br>Connect, Chat, Shout UNO!\u2122<br>Connect with your buddies in UNO!\u2122 with clubs and send each other gifts. Make a strategy and remember to shout UNO before anyone else.<br><br>New Challenges at Every Level<br>Compete in spine-chilling World Series tournaments and special events to win free rewards. Top the leaderboards and show off to your friends and family! Then spin the wheel and try your fortune to get free rewards every day!<br><br>Go Wild \u2013 No, Really<br>This no-holds-barred mode is as wild as UNO!\u2122 gets. Forget the classic mode - haunted house rules on, two-deck play, and free winnings up to 600 times what you put in to make you the coin master! But beware, in this unpredictable game mode, it&#39;s a gaming trick or treat where you either win big or go home empty-handed! Are you up for the challenge?<br><br>UNO!\u2122 Esports<br>The UNO!\u2122 Mobile Community Cup 2024 is now open! Players across countries including the USA, Canada, Brazil, and Mexico can join for a year of action-packed competitions and tons of ghostly rewards! This is your chance to make it big as an eSports star!<br><br>Visit our official site at www.letsplayuno.com<br>Follow us on Facebook for more updates: www.facebook.com/UNOnow",
